  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 890ab52acda4f5fcdf5830fffec0362b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Briefing3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TahaYasin.Runtime::PresidentialBriefingData
  briefingId: president_3
  afterScenario: 6
  heading: "DO\u011ERU B\u0130LG\u0130, DO\u011ERU SEVK"
  dialogueLines:
  - "Her ihbar bir ekibin yolunu de\u011Fi\u015Ftiriyor. Yanl\u0131\u015F bir adres ya da do\u011Frulanmam\u0131\u015F bir haber, ba\u015Fka bir evin kap\u0131s\u0131na ula\u015Fmam\u0131z\u0131 geciktirebilir."
  - "Acil hatlar\u0131 ger\xE7ek acil durumlar i\xE7in a\xE7\u0131k tutal\u0131m. \u0130hbarda konumu ve g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCm\xFCz durumu a\xE7\u0131k\xE7a aktaral\u0131m. Do\u011Frulanmam\u0131\u015F haberleri payla\u015Fmayal\u0131m; resm\xEE a\xE7\u0131klamalar\u0131 izleyelim."
  - "Alt\u0131 vakan\u0131n ard\u0131ndan kalan g\xFCc\xFCm\xFCz ekranda. Yang\u0131nlara ayr\u0131lan kapasiteyi art\u0131rmak kurtarma yede\u011Fini azaltacak. Saha eri\u015Fimine a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131k vermek ise ambulans deste\u011Finden fedak\xE2rl\u0131k isteyecek."
  planA:
    title: "YANGIN \xC7EMBER\u0130"
    rationale: "Kurtarma yede\u011Fi daral\u0131r; yang\u0131n m\xFCdahalesi g\xFC\xE7lenir."
    ambulances: 1
    firefighters: 4
    thirdTeam: -3
  planB:
    title: "G\xDCVENL\u0130 ER\u0130\u015E\u0130M"
    rationale: "Sa\u011Fl\u0131k yede\u011Fi azal\u0131r; kurtarma ve yang\u0131n hatt\u0131 b\xFCy\xFCr."
    ambulances: -2
    firefighters: 2
    thirdTeam: 4
  closing: "Da\u011F\u0131l\u0131m g\xFCncellendi. Kayna\u011F\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 korumak, yard\u0131m isteyen bir sonraki ki\u015Fiye zaman kazand\u0131rmakt\u0131r. G\xF6revinize devam edin."
  endsShift: 0
